 "arrive_text": "Cenabum of the Carnutes: a river town of thatch and mud inside an earth rampart, with one long wooden bridge over the Liger and a quarter of Roman houses with their roofs fallen in. This is where it started. The men who did it still walk past the gutted houses every day, and nobody looks at them.",
